  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/xsnn6nf\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Extended Illumina</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEA</a></span> 由 </strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbeacons.ai%252filyastik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ilyastik</a></strong></span></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Extended Illumina 是一款資源包，為您的手中加入 3D 燈籠與火把，非常適合追求沉浸式的角色扮演體驗。</strong></span></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\">Extended Illumina 不會添加自訂模型或材質，因此幾乎可與所有燈籠或火把的資源包相容。</em></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>DYNAMIC LIGHTS</em></span> 建議搭配使用以獲得更佳體驗！</em></p>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p><strong>原版版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/extended-illumina\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended illumina</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.16 - 1.21</strong></p>\n<p>🧡</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
